 "name_en": "Basic Business Process Scheduling (6JM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Basic Business Process Scheduling (6JM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Before you can execute business process scheduling, you must perform configuration to activate it.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You first create or change a business document, such as a sales order, with the business process scheduling functionality activated. You can schedule logistically relevant date types that are available at the schedule line level in the sales order (for example, material availability date, delivery date) with the new Business Process Scheduling (BPS) solution using days as the time granularity. BPS is used through the creation or change of a sales document (for example, a sales order).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Activate business process scheduling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute business process scheduling when creating or changing business document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule different date types</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Decouple business documents (such as sales orders) from a concrete scheduling application</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable a fully flexible configuration of duration, calendar, and time zone for each defined logistical activity</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule the relevant date types (for example, delivery date) in your business process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Define points in time in your logistical business process (start or end of logistical activities, for example, or start of loading), for which BPS returns a scheduled date and time zone, and optionally, times</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基本业务流程计划 (6JM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在执行业务流程计划之前，必须执行配置才能将其激活。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">首先创建或更改业务凭证（如销售订单），并激活业务流程计划功能。您可以使用新的业务流程计划 (BPS) 解决方案（使用天作为时间粒度）计划销售订单中计划行级别可用的物流相关日期类型（例如，物料可用日期、交货日期）。通过创建或更改销售凭证（例如，销售订单）使用 BPS。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">激活业务流程计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建或更改业务凭证时，执行业务流程计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计划不同的日期类型</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8572d93e57ce4f6485a5de7afd6571e7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将业务凭证（例如销售订单）从具体的计划应用程序中分离</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为每个定义的物流活动启用完全灵活的持续时间、日历和时区配置</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在业务流程中计划相关日期类型（例如，交货日期）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在您的物流业务流程中定义时间点（例如，物流活动的开始或结束，或装货开始），BPS 会为其返回计划日期和时区，也可以返回时间</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
